{"read_id": "READ-20261208-ce5276", "session_id": "SESSION-20261208-df05cd", "target": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261122-53ccf2"}, "reading": "used_as_context", "note": "本文全文。『要約は腐らない』を、分配と味見の区別の側から確認した。", "created_at": "2026-12-08"}
